<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113453" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρτός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>causing delight, welcome,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρτὸν εἴ τι καὶ φέρεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					228
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίροις ἄν, εἴ σοι χαρτὰ τυγχάνει
					τάδε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>El.</u>
					1457
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴτε ἡδὺ εἴτε τερπνὸν λέγεις εἴτε
					χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					358a
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρτά</span>
			<i>delights,</i> opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακά, χαρτοῖσιν χαῖρε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archil.
					66.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρτὰ πάσχω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					618
				</span></i>
			 (troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Chrysipp.Stoic.
					3.9
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Epicur.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				423
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				11.85
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of
			persons, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ χ. ἀνέλθοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.24
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Tull.Laur.
			</span></i>). Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-τῶς, χ. ἐμοὶ λέγειν</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				<u>S.Aj.</u>
				112
			</span></i>.</div>
